Subject: sunxi: H713: support the native V2 display assets

Select the firmware length, digest and guarded HDMI initialization
timeout site from the board's device tree. Pin V2's native fastlogo
table and use its project 0x34 ranges. Keep the A1 diagnostic patches
scoped to their original firmware revision.

Declare the V2 panel supply and reset in U-Boot's control tree so the
manual display sequence can drive them.

For FEL testing, the operator can stage the 648-byte timing block 6
(offset 0x1654 in the A1 LogoRegData.bin) at 0x60000000 and set
h713_v2_a1_timing=yes before running h713_disp auto 0x34 logo. Only
substitute the block after its digest matches. This keeps the native V2
firmware, project data, prologue, and DE block in use.

